# Webview (React / Tailwind)

Follow [CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md) “WebView Frontend” and [docs/ELEMENT_UNIFIED_BLUEPRINT.md](docs/ELEMENT_UNIFIED_BLUEPRINT.md).

## Visual language

- **Neumorphism** on a continuous dark chassis — not glassmorphism (no heavy blur/transparency-as-chrome).
- Semantic colours: audio blue `#4A90D9`, MIDI teal `#2BC4C4`, value/CV orange `#E8A838`; surface tokens as in CLAUDE.

## Commands

```bash
cd webview
npm install
npm run dev      # dev server (e.g. localhost:5173)
npx tsc -b       # typecheck
npm run build    # production → webview/dist/
```

